(in bash, OSX) if I type<p><pre><code>  $ type cd
    cd is a function
    cd () 
    { 
      builtin cd "$@";
      local result=$?;
      __rvm_project_rvmrc;
      __rvm_after_cd;
      return $result
    }
</code></pre>
